  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Giant Giant was a temporary troop appearing in the Friend or Foe medal event. He was unlocked when 100 are obtained. Since the end of the ClashaMania season, he can now only be summoned by the Action Figure.",
    "He is a massive Giant with extremely high hitpoints and high damage per second. He deals splash damage, allowing him to damage defenses behind Walls as well as attack groups of defending troops. He also has a hidden 2x damage multiplier against Walls.",
    "When reduced to half health, the Giant Giant will enter an enraged state where he gains increased damage and movement speed. This rage effect lasts for 20 seconds."
  ],
  "notices": [
